- Hey.

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:04.490
I just got here.

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:05.420
- Oh, OK.

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:07.720
I'll be there in a second.

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:08.220
- Perfect.

